WEBVTT

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.140
Jimmy to the middle, feet together.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.380
You need to get the wave before it breaks.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.260
Christian, hold on.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:21.720
You ready?

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.440
You got this!

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.740
Paddle, paddle, paddle!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.660
Just let go.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:38.980
Woohoo!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.760
I want to live on through your drawings.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.580
Promise me that you'll tell our story.
